RC or PLC in Oconto County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/oconto-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, January to February on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Oconto County came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951. On the middle of the grids, September to October ran 48% of normal in 2025 and October to November ran 43% in 2025. The 2026 numbers so far look wetter, with March to April at 217% in 2026 on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
